---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";
---

<LegalPage
  title="Do Not Sell My Info"
  updated="August 7, 2026"
  description="How to opt out of the disclosure of your personal information under CCPA/CPRA and other applicable privacy laws."
>
  <p>
    <em
      >This is a placeholder draft for a pre-launch product and has not been
      reviewed by a lawyer. Before publishing, this page requires legal
      review to confirm whether conference.contact's disclosure of business
      contact information to paying subscribers constitutes a "sale" or
      "share" of personal information under the CCPA/CPRA, and to confirm the
      opt-out mechanism below satisfies that determination.</em
    >
  </p>

  <h2>Your right to opt out</h2>
  <p>
    Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), California residents
    have the right to opt out of the sale or sharing of their personal
    information.
  </p>
  <p>
    conference.contact discloses business contact information — which may
    include your name, title, company, email, and phone number — to paying
    subscribers as part of our directory service. If you would rather your
    information not be disclosed to subscribers in this way, or if you want a
    business contact record about you corrected or removed from our
    directory entirely, you can submit a request below.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Identifiers — name, email address, IP address</li>
    <li>Account and subscription information</li>
    <li>Usage data — pages visited, browser type</li>
    <li>
      Business contact information compiled from publicly available sources
      into directory profiles
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Submit a request</h2>
  <p>
    Fill out the form below with your name and the email address associated
    with your request. We will verify your identity before processing
    certain requests (such as correction or removal) to protect against
    fraudulent or unauthorized submissions. We'll respond within 45 days; if
    we need more time, we'll notify you and may extend this by up to an
    additional 45 days as permitted by law.
  </p>

  <form class="not-prose mt-6 flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-bg-soft p-6" data-static="true">
    <div>
      <label for="dns-name" class="mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink">Full name</label>
      <input
        id="dns-name"
        type="text"
        required
        placeholder="Jane Smith"
        class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[14px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-faint focus:border-navy focus:outline-none"
      />
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="dns-email" class="mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink">Email address</label>
      <input
        id="dns-email"
        type="email"
        required
        placeholder="jane@company.com"
        class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[14px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-faint focus:border-navy focus:outline-none"
      />
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="dns-reason" class="mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink">Request type</label>
      <select
        id="dns-reason"
        class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[14px] text-ink focus:border-navy focus:outline-none"
      >
        <option>Opt out of sale/sharing of personal information</option>
        <option>Correct a directory record about me</option>
        <option>Remove a directory record about me</option>
        <option>Other privacy request</option>
      </select>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="dns-message" class="mb-1.5 block text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink">Details</label>
      <textarea
        id="dns-message"
        rows="4"
        placeholder="Tell us more…"
        class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-line bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[14px] text-ink placeholder:text-ink-faint focus:border-navy focus:outline-none"
      ></textarea>
    </div>

    <button
      type="submit"
      class="mt-1 rounded-xl bg-navy px-6 py-3.5 text-[15px] font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-navy-mid"
    >
      Submit request
    </button>
  </form>

  <p>
    We also recognize opt-out preference signals, such as the Global Privacy
    Control (GPC), as a valid method of submitting a request to opt out of
    sale or sharing, where legally required.
  </p>

  <h2>No discrimination</h2>
  <p>
    We won't discriminate against you for exercising your privacy rights —
    you won't be charged a different price or denied service for submitting a
    request.
  </p>

  <h2>Record retention</h2>
  <p>
    We retain records of privacy requests and our responses for the period
    required by applicable law, for compliance and audit purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>More information</h2>
  <p>
    See our full <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for more about the information
    we collect and your rights.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
